WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,600
It's so righteous that I let you withdraw with such wealth.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,400
But he still used his family's farmland, opened a restaurant, and even beat people on the street.

3
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:14,770
That's called making exceptions in business. If you hit someone, at least he won.

4
00:00:14,770 --> 00:00:18,170
Besides, Chen Guogong is about to be reactivated by His Majesty.

5
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:22,570
If Fangyang can really make Tianxianwu, Chen Guogong's mansion may not be defeated.

6
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:24,370
The marriage certificate has been torn up

7
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:33,350
Fangyang, how many secrets are you hiding?

8
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:35,210
Sons and ministers meet their father

9
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:36,810
What does the prince want from me?

10
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:39,610
Father, son, Chen practiced a calligraphy in his heart

11
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:43,370
I always feel that there are some problems with the writing. I would like to ask my father to help me take a look.

12
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:52,820
Oh, bring it to me and have a look

13
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,420
This is what you wrote

14
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:56,860
This is what Chen Guogong’s only son Fangyang said

15
00:00:56,860 --> 00:01:00,460
Erchen thought this statement was very good, so he wrote it down.

16
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:04,460
Just writing this casually does not mean that I am incompetent.

17
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:05,460
I don't dare

18
00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:08,730
I dare not not do it too

19
00:01:08,730 --> 00:01:10,720
Go back and tell Changle

20
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:15,120
We chefs have no precedent of relying on a princess’ marriage to buy peace.

21
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,520
Father is wise
